WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Open the bundled Marble Terrain Remix as an editable copy.

00:08.000 --> 00:16.000
Open native 3D controls and freeze the current marble positions.

00:16.000 --> 00:20.000
Arrange the marbles in a ring.

00:20.000 --> 00:24.000
Apply a colourful palette.

00:24.000 --> 00:31.000
Try a line arrangement, then undo it.

00:31.000 --> 00:37.000
Convert recorded trajectories into editable curve objects.

00:37.000 --> 00:41.000
Orbit the 3D scene with the pointer.

00:41.000 --> 00:47.000
Save a named branch and open export controls.

00:47.000 --> 00:52.000
Export a real rendered PNG.